2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148426 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:48 *** TC_26_6_5_2_1: Non-synchronised Handover to Frequency Hopping Channel ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148440 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:49 "*** Reference: GSM 04.08 " & char(0, 0, 0, 167) & " 26.6.5.2.1                                     ***"
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148468 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:50 ==============================================================================
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148480 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:51 *** PURPOSE:                                                                ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148502 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:52 ***   Verify that MS correctly performs non-synchronised (asynchronous)     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148523 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:53 ***   handover from a non-hopping SDCCH to a frequency-hopping TCH/F,       ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148535 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:54 ***   including:                                                             ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148547 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:55 ***     - Continuous access burst transmission until PHYSICAL INFO received ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148558 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:56 ***     - Correct Timing Advance and Starting Time handling                 ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148570 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:57 ***     - Correct new channel activation                                    ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148593 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:58 ***     - Layer 3 message retransmission after handover completion          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148605 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:59 ==============================================================================
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148617 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:61 ==============================================================================
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148629 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:62 *** INFRASTRUCTURE LIMITATION ANALYSIS                                      ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148640 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:63 ==============================================================================
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148652 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:65 --- LIMIT-1: Frequency Hopping (FH) Not Supported in Virtual PHY ---
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148664 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:66 *** The target channel for this handover is a frequency-hopping TCH/F.     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148675 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:67 *** Spec line [5] +FullRateCh_B_1 uses FreqTCHb_hof3 (hopping config).     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148687 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:68 *** Spec line [10] +ltree_sendHoCMD sends HandOverCmd_fh with:             ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148699 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:69 ***   - TSPX_HSN (Hopping Sequence Number)                                  ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148710 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:70 ***   - Freqchseq_06 / Frql_20_B5d (frequency hopping sequence lists)      ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148722 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:71 *** Comment at line 187: 'HO from SDCCH/4_nonFH to TCH/F_FH'               ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148733 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:72 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148745 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:73 *** osmo-virtphy (src/virt_phy/src/l1ctl_sap.c, line ~560) contains:       ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148757 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:74 ***   OSMO_ASSERT(est_req->h == 0);  /* no hopping support */               ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148772 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:75 *** Any attempt to activate a frequency-hopping channel (h=1) triggers      ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148784 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:76 *** an immediate assertion crash of the virtual PHY process.                ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148795 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:77 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148801 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:78 *** Real frequency hopping requires:                                        ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148804 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:79 ***   - RF hardware with synchronized frequency synthesizer                 ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148808 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:80 ***   - TDMA frame-accurate hopping sequence generation                     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148811 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:81 ***   - Physical RF carrier switching at 217 hops/second                    ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148815 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:82 *** None of these are possible in the GSMTAP-based virtual environment.     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148819 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:84 --- LIMIT-2: Multi-Cell Handover Infrastructure Not Available ---
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148830 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:85 *** Spec line [4] +StartCellB_ho starts a second cell (Cell B) for HO.     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148834 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:86 *** Non-synchronised handover requires:                                     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148837 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:87 ***   - Two independent BTS instances (Cell A + Cell B)                     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148841 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:88 ***   - Frame-level timing offset management (non-coincident timeslots)     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148844 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:89 ***   - Spec comment line 42: 'The timeslots of Cells A and B are not      ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148848 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:90 ***     coincident at the antenna connector.'                               ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148852 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:91 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148855 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:92 *** Current infrastructure: single osmo-bts-virtual + single virtphy.       ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148858 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:93 *** No mechanism exists to instantiate or coordinate a second BTS cell.     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148862 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:94 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148866 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:95 *** OM_StartCell() operations in the spec require BSC-level cell activation ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148869 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:96 *** control not exposed via the MSC stub interface. The bsc-stub does not   ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148873 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:97 *** implement multi-cell coordination or second-BTS channel activation.     ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148876 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:99 --- LIMIT-3: Physical Layer Access Burst Monitoring Unavailable ---
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148880 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:100 *** Purpose 1: Verify MS 'continuously sends access bursts on the main      ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148884 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:101 ***   DCCH until it receives a PHYSICAL INFORMATION from the SS.'           ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148887 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:102 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148891 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:103 *** This requires:                                                           ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148896 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:104 ***   - Capturing raw access bursts at the physical layer                   ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148899 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:105 ***   - Frame-accurate timing verification of burst repetition               ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148903 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:106 ***   - Precise injection of PHYSICAL INFORMATION message at L1              ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148910 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:107 ***   - Measuring MS response within sub-millisecond timing windows          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148914 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:108 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148918 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:109 *** osmo-virtphy does not maintain a real TDMA frame clock. GSMTAP packet   ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148922 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:110 *** timestamps lack the precision needed for frame-level burst timing       ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148925 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:111 *** verification. Physical layer message injection (PHYSICAL INFORMATION)   ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148929 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:112 *** is not supported in the virtual environment.                             ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148933 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:114 --- LIMIT-4: Asynchronous Handover Timing Coordination ---
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148936 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:115 "*** Spec line [5] +FullRateCh_B_1( C_Asynho, ... ) " & char(0, 0, 32, 20) & " asynchronous handover. ***"
