2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148965 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:117 ***   - TimingAdv(20) on Cell B vs TimingAdv(30) on Cell A                  ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148969 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:118 ***   - Frame offset coordination (line 39: TSPX_k, frame_offset parameter) ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148972 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:119 ***   - Starting Time IE processing to align channel activation              ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148976 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:120 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148980 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:121 *** virtphy has no concept of inter-cell frame timing offsets. It cannot    ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148984 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:122 *** emulate a scenario where two cells have non-coincident TDMA frames.     ***
