2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148992 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:125 *** Purpose 4 (spec line 121-124): Verify that the MS retransmits the      ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148995 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:126 ***   last unacknowledged Layer 3 message (SETUP) after handover with       ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.148999 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:127 ***   the same send sequence number N(SD).                                  ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.149002 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:128 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.149006 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:129 *** Spec line [16]: L?DL_DatInSetup                                         ***
