2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.149013 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:131 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.149016 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:132 *** This requires:                                                           ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.149022 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:133 ***   - Capturing L3 message before handover (SETUP not acknowledged)       ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.149025 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:134 ***   - Successfully completing handover (blocked by LIMIT-1, LIMIT-2)      ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.149029 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:135 ***   - Receiving retransmitted SETUP on new channel                        ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.149033 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:136 ***   - Extracting and comparing N(SD) bit field from L3 header             ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.149036 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:137 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.149040 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:138 *** Since the handover itself cannot execute (FH crash + no multi-cell),    ***
2026/Jun/26 10:28:29.149046 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:139 *** the retransmission verification path is unreachable.                     ***
